        "text": "Page: Les Clark. Sentence: Joining Disney in 1927, he was the only one to work on the origins of Mickey Mouse with Ub Iwerks.\nPage: Ub Iwerks. Sentence: Ubbe Eert \"Ub\" Iwerks, A.S.C. ( ; March 24, 1901 – July 7, 1971) was an American animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, and special effects technician, who created Oswald the Lucky Rabbit and Mickey Mouse with Walt Disney.\nPage: Plane Crazy. Sentence: Plane Crazy is an American animated short film directed by Walt Disney and Ub Iwerks.",
